{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 What the game IS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ~2\u2011hour, self\u2011contained, atmospheric narrative experience designed to be completed in one sitting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused on exploration and discovery, with only light logic puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist controls - WASD to move, E to interact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light\u2011hearted tone - the game doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u274c What the game is NOT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Subsequence</i> is not a traditional, puzzle\u2011heavy adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re looking for complex logic puzzles, long playtime, or branching dialogue trees, this may not be the right experience for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> \ud83c\udfae Demo</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free demo is available and reflects the tone and core mechanics of the full game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best experienced with headphones</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subsequence takes you through an underground research facility, a burning elevator shaft, a flooded supply tunnel, even a toilet or outer space. By coincidence, the main heroine Vicky finds herself trapped in the underground labs. Things quickly spiral out of control and Vicky must fight for her life. Expect tense moments carefully balanced with a touch of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/5099e7270ce54d6f002a6260b5523615.poster.avif?t=1771794929\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/5099e7270ce54d6f002a6260b5523615.webm?t=1771794929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/89d1d3dae011f3f73957aa9d9b74f516.webp?t=1771794929\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysterious underground labs and uncover the secrets behind a strange incident tied to your brother Vincent\u2019s research. On your quest for survival, you\u2019ll overcome environmental obstacles, solve engaging puzzles and collect useful items scattered across the facility. Hidden collectibles await, unlocking new features and revealing more about the world of Subsequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/c93dd3a15ce53152019cc35976de4a9e.poster.avif?t=1771794929\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/c93dd3a15ce53152019cc35976de4a9e.webm?t=1771794929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/59a0b05c36fbc0175b29b5114f794dd5.webp?t=1771794929\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant world - from secret laboratories and burning elevator shafts to sleek spaceship interiors and Vicky\u2019s cozy home where a cute animal claims its territory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve clever logic puzzles and whatever you do, don\u2019t cross the laser beam, it will cut you in half</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and use items scattered throughout the facility to overcome obstacles and survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in deep conversations - without a single dialogue choice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden collectibles to unlock new features and uncover more about the world of Subsequence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy intuitive controls with just WASD or a gamepad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience tension and humor carefully balanced for maximum fun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/bd8d24dd11f31ea2b9e6e1e166b79e85.poster.avif?t=1771794929\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/bd8d24dd11f31ea2b9e6e1e166b79e85.webm?t=1771794929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/44822bca366017f12c33cc6c354b6710.webp?t=1771794929\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subsequence doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously. It\u2019s a relaxed adventure with no hardcore puzzles, just enjoy the ride and, most importantly, have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/d9bab73110587f510c28b7ea7705a298.poster.avif?t=1771794929\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/d9bab73110587f510c28b7ea7705a298.webm?t=1771794929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAME CONTROLS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control everything with WASD for movement and E for interaction or use a gamepad if you prefer. Interactive spots are clearly marked, so no pixel hunting required. Objectives appear in the top-left corner, complete them to progress to the next location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1936530?t=1771794929","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1936530?t=1771794929","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/b416784d2796ad564ae0b5103259b8f5ed09dcea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771794929","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/b416784d2796ad564ae0b5103259b8f5ed09dcea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771794929","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There are motionless characters in some locations but all the character's models are stylized into completely black silhouette, no textures at all. Sometimes there is visible blood."},"demos":[{"appid":4243780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 What the game IS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ~2\u2011hour, self\u2011contained, atmospheric narrative experience designed to be completed in one sitting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused on exploration and discovery, with only light logic puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist controls - WASD to move, E to interact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light\u2011hearted tone - the game doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u274c What the game is NOT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Subsequence</i> is not a traditional, puzzle\u2011heavy adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re looking for complex logic puzzles, long playtime, or branching dialogue trees, this may not be the right experience for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> \ud83c\udfae Demo</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free demo is available and reflects the tone and core mechanics of the full game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best experienced with headphones</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subsequence takes you through an underground research facility, a burning elevator shaft, a flooded supply tunnel, even a toilet or outer space. By coincidence, the main heroine Vicky finds herself trapped in the underground labs. Things quickly spiral out of control and Vicky must fight for her life. Expect tense moments carefully balanced with a touch of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/5099e7270ce54d6f002a6260b5523615.poster.avif?t=1771794929\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/5099e7270ce54d6f002a6260b5523615.webm?t=1771794929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></s