ed throughout the facility to overcome obstacles and survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in deep conversations - without a single dialogue choice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden collectibles to unlock new features and uncover more about the world of Subsequence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy intuitive controls with just WASD or a gamepad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience tension and humor carefully balanced for maximum fun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/bd8d24dd11f31ea2b9e6e1e166b79e85.poster.avif?t=1771794929\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/bd8d24dd11f31ea2b9e6e1e166b79e85.webm?t=1771794929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/44822bca366017f12c33cc6c354b6710.webp?t=1771794929\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subsequence doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously. It\u2019s a relaxed adventure with no hardcore puzzles, just enjoy the ride and, most importantly, have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/d9bab73110587f510c28b7ea7705a298.poster.avif?t=1771794929\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/d9bab73110587f510c28b7ea7705a298.webm?t=1771794929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAME CONTROLS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control everything with WASD for movement and E for interaction or use a gamepad if you prefer. Interactive spots are clearly marked, so no pixel hunting required. Objectives appear in the top-left corner, complete them to progress to the next location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Zoemi Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/1daedd03ef970f4db9e23ff342c06db2c25c0aa7/header.jpg?t=1771794929","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1936530/989986136/46bade3ee881455724bb0115256a6ac421143724/1761423908/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764278517","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1936530/989986136/46bade3ee881455724bb0115256a6ac421143724/1761423908/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764278517","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1936530/989986136/46bade3ee881455724bb0115256a6ac421143724/1761423908/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764278517","id":257222552,"name":"Subsequence - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257222552/ef630b93f7bfa6bb779e0033b78aeb53d356e294/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764278517"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1936530/11982554/0661b4133f3b85221981cf753975d52ac1c13215/1767729828/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767730916